<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 124-4 AT LUNCH V GLOUCESTERSHIRE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 124-4 AT LUNCH V GLOUCESTERSHIRE.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, England 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 124 for four at lunch on the first day of their three day match against Gloucestershire on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Score: Australia 124-4 (M. Waugh 66).</p>
